---
title: "Notebook — Collin Westerlund"
description: "Short dispatches — new videos, sessions, and notes from Collin Westerlund."
canonical: "/notebook.html"
nav: "notebook"
permalink: "notebook.html"
layout: base.njk
---

<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap ph-grid">
    <div class="ph-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Notes From The Room</p>
    <h1>The Notebook</h1>
    <p class="lede">Short dispatches from Collin &mdash; what he's recording, what he's listening to, and what's coming next out of the Baltimore room.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="ph-photo"><img src="assets/img/sess3.jpg" alt="Collin at the mixing desk in his recording room" width="640" height="800"><figcaption>The Baltimore room</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</header>

<section style="border-bottom:none">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="entries">
{%- for e in notebook.items | newestFirst %}
      <article class="entry">
        <div class="ed">{{ e.date | monDayYear }}</div>
        <h3>{{ e.title }}</h3>
        {{ e.body | md | safe }}
        {%- if e.youtube %}
        <div class="frame"><iframe loading="lazy" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ e.youtube }}" title="{{ e.title }}" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>{% endif %}
        {%- if e.spotify %}
        <div class="sp-frame"><iframe loading="lazy" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/{{ e.spotify }}?utm_source=generator&amp;theme=0" title="{{ e.title }} on Spotify" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div>{% endif %}
      </article>
{%- endfor %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

